Scope of the MIT grant

Goker Ariyak (ARIYAK, GitHub account gokeranok-ui) licenses under the MIT
terms above all original material in this repository for which he controls
the copyright. This includes his MATLAB scripts, fuzzy inference system
definitions, Simulink model design and modifications, build and workflow
files, documentation, diagrams, photographs, and original elements of
screenshots. For a file with more than one source, this grant covers the
portions for which he controls the rights.

